# Generated MDX. Its exact line structure is semantically significant: blockquotes are
# emitted on ONE line on purpose, because splitting them makes MDX treat the inner text
# as a paragraph and wrap it in <p> — which puts <footer> inside a <p>, where it is
# invalid. Prettier reformats them and reintroduces exactly that bug (90 occurrences).
